t":"Haram mutlak","isCorrect":true},{"id":"opt-6-b","text":"Makruh tanzih","isCorrect":false},{"id":"opt-6-c","text":"Mubah jika berniat puasa sunnah","isCorrect":false},{"id":"opt-6-d","text":"Sunnah muakkadah","isCorrect":false},{"id":"opt-6-e","text":"Fardhu kifayah","isCorrect":false}],"correctOptionId":"opt-6-a","points":10,"category":"Shiyam (Puasa)","difficulty":"mudah"},{"id":"q-7","number":7,"type":"multiple_choice","text":"Rukun haji yang membedakannya secara pokok dengan ibadah umrah karena hanya dilakukan pada ibadah haji adalah...","options":[{"id":"opt-7-a","text":"Wukuf di Padang Arafah","isCorrect":true},{"id":"opt-7-b","text":"Thawaf mengelilingi Ka\'bah 7 kali","isCorrect":false},{"id":"opt-7-c","text":"Sa\'i antara Shafa dan Marwah","isCorrect":false},{"id":"opt-7-d","text":"Tahallul (mencukur rambut)","isCorrect":false},{"id":"opt-7-e","text":"Niat ihram dari miqat","isCorrect":false}],"correctOptionId":"opt-7-a","points":10,"category":"Haji & Umrah","difficulty":"sedang"},{"id":"q-8","number":8,"type":"multiple_choice","text":"Dalam ketentuan kurban (udhiyah), seekor sapi atau unta secara syar\'i sah diperuntukkan atas nama patungan maksimal sebanyak...","options":[{"id":"opt-8-a","text":"7 orang shohibul qurban","isCorrect":true},{"id":"opt-8-b","text":"5 orang shohibul qurban","isCorrect":false},{"id":"opt-8-c","text":"10 orang shohibul qurban","isCorrect":false},{"id":"opt-8-d","text":"1 orang saja","isCorrect":false},{"id":"opt-8-e","text":"3 orang shohibul qurban","isCorrect":false}],"correctOptionId":"opt-8-a","points":10,"category":"Qurban & Aqiqah","difficulty":"sedang"},{"id":"q-9","number":9,"type":"multiple_choice","text":"Hak memilih bagi pihak penjual dan pembeli untuk meneruskan atau membatalkan akad jual beli selama masih berada di tempat transaksi disebut...","options":[{"id":"opt-9-a","text":"Khiyar Majlis","isCorrect":true},{"id":"opt-9-b","text":"Khiyar Syarath","isCorrect":false},{"id":"opt-9-c","text":"Khiyar Aibi","isCorrec